          "text": "Memory and medication-taking"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports increased forgetfulness about medications and sometimes says he has taken them so staff will stop asking. RACF chart shows multiple metoprolol refusals this month. On 22/11/25, after discussion, he took all morning medications and said “I’ll give it a go for a bit”."
